msgctxt "168"
msgid "Wow, that was incredible!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid "Yeah, sukiyaki's the bomb!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"Mitsuo, Riona. It's your turn to do the dishes tonight.\r\n"
"Go get started, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "Going!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid ""
"By the way, Uncle Kaz. There's, um... something I need to\r\n"
"do in town, so I'm gonna go out for a bit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "No you're not. It's not safe for a young girl to be out this late."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid "It won't be too long, promise. Bye!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid ""
"(...First all that suspicious stuff this afternoon, then what\r\n"
"Mikio told me, and now this. Probably wouldn't hurt to go\r\n"
"keep an eye on her.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid ""
"(So Taichi's allergic to buckwheat. Guess we'll need to be\r\n"
"more careful about what we eat from now on.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid ""
"(Still nothing from Tamiya, too. Looks like Toma's gonna\r\n"
"be stuck in that meeting all day, just like he said.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "Oh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid ""
"Haruka? What's the rush? You could have really gotten hurt if I wasn't "
"paying attention."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid ""
"Huh? Oh, um... It's nothing! Just thought I'd go get some\r\n"
"groceries for dinner."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid "Perfect, I'll come with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid ""
"Oh! You, um... You don't need to do that, Uncle Kaz! I'm sure you're tired "
"after your trip down here! Oh, and all that wrestling, too! You should "
"relax!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid "I actually feel pretty fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid ""
"That's what you say now, but you'll be complaining later if\r\n"
"you don't have any downtime. See you later, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid ""
"(That was... strange. I wonder if she's really going\r\n"
"shopping.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid "(Wait. She's not going on a date, is she!?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid ""
"(Maybe I should see what she's up to. Can't hurt to just take a peek, "
"right?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid "(But what if she finds out? Hmmm.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid "(What am I thinking? I can't spy on her!)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid ""
"(Besides, she's getting to be that age. Going on a date here\r\n"
"or there might not be the worst thing in the world for her.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid "(Even so...)"
msgstr "Anche così..."

msgctxt "516"
msgid "(I should probably be there to protect her if anything happens.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid ""
"(Yeah, that sounds plausible enough. Well, guess I should\r\n"
"head after her. I think she went toward downtown.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid "(No! I can't spy on my kids!)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid "(Maybe a nice walk on the beach will take my mind off this...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid "Uncle Kaz! Have you seen Haruka?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid "Yeah, just now. She said she was going shopping."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid ""
"Darn, I must've just missed her! She forgot her shopping\r\n"
"list on the table, too..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "612"
msgid ""
"Knowing Haruka, I'm sure she has the whole thing memorized,\r\n"
"but maybe I should run after her just in case."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "624"
msgid "Wait! I'll give it to her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "636"
msgid ""
"Huh? But you just got back. I don't mind going if you're too\r\n"
"tired, Uncle Kaz."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid ""
"I was actually just thinking of taking a walk downtown\r\n"
"anyway. It's been way too long."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "660"
msgid "But it was just three days..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "672"
msgid ""
"Yeah, well... it felt a lot longer than that. Either way,\r\n"
"I could use a nice walk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "684"
msgid "If you say so! Here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "696"
msgid "Thanks, Ayako. I'll make sure she gets it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "720"
msgid "(Maybe I should see what she's up to.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "732"
msgid "(I can't spy on her!)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "744"
msgid "(Yeah. That sounds plausible.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "756"
msgid "(<Italic>No</Italic>!)"
msgstr ""

